<LegalPage title="Terms of use" description="The terms for using MyAvedan." updated="17 November 2026">
  <h2>What MyAvedan is</h2>
  <p>
    MyAvedan, operated by TrutiAI, summarises official recruitment notices, explains their rules and helps you keep track of dates. It
    is not a government website, does not run recruitments and cannot accept applications or payments.
  </p>

  <h2>Information on the site</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We take care to match every listing to the official notice, and a person reviews key facts before publishing.</li>
    <li>Recruiting authorities can change dates, rules and vacancies at any time. The official notification is always the authority.</li>
    <li>Eligibility results are guidance based on the published rules and the details you enter. They do not guarantee eligibility, selection or acceptance of your application.</li>
    <li>Explanations produced with the help of AI may contain errors.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Using the site</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Use MyAvedan for your own job search and preparation.</li>
    <li>Do not try to disrupt the service, scrape it at high volume or misuse the error-report form.</li>
    <li>Links to official websites take you to services we do not control.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms. The date at the top shows when they last changed.</p>
</LegalPage>
